  "Notes": [
    {
      "Id": "357603add19476738770b76f57b5f3b5",
      "Text": "WHAT IT DOES: finds every item that carries the property, reads its value, and gives each distinct value its own colour. The Watch shows which colour went with which value. TO CHANGE: edit the two text inputs on the left (Element > Level here), then press Run.",
